Arun Kumar Majumder, IIT Kharagpur. Introduction to Mineral Processing, archived 2018 NPTEL course. [Official course and twelve-week layout](https://onlinecourses-archive.nptel.ac.in/noc18_ce14/preview).

Complete the public sequence: particle characterization, comminution, screening, movement in fluids, hydrocyclones, gravity concentration, flotation, bulk handling, slurry transport, and iron-ore washing. Read the complete corresponding CETEM chapters and practical methods alongside it. The reference list points to Wills' commercial textbook, accessed separately where used.

Instructor, archived course identity, scope, prerequisites, and public layout checked on 29 October 2026. Preserve actual lecture/component terms; archived enrolment/exam information is not presented as current availability or a Lince learning requirement. No videos, transcripts, or exercise data are bundled.

